{"page":40,"width":2000,"height":2831,"text_angle":0,"lines":[{"text":"32","words":[{"text":"32","x":211,"y":136,"width":48,"height":36}]},{"text":"CHAPTER 01 • 컴퓨터 네트워크와 인터넷","words":[{"text":"CHAPTER","x":599,"y":138,"width":125,"height":25},{"text":"01","x":735,"y":138,"width":30,"height":25},{"text":"•","x":801,"y":143,"width":12,"height":13},{"text":"컴퓨터","x":846,"y":137,"width":76,"height":30},{"text":"네트워크와","x":935,"y":136,"width":131,"height":30},{"text":"인터넷","x":1077,"y":136,"width":78,"height":30}]},{"text":"이 다양하며, 여러 대륙과 대양에 걸쳐 서비스히는 것도 있고, 매우 지리적으로 좁은","words":[{"text":"이","x":577,"y":268,"width":29,"height":38},{"text":"다양하며,","x":625,"y":267,"width":143,"height":39},{"text":"여러","x":786,"y":265,"width":63,"height":39},{"text":"대륙과","x":869,"y":265,"width":101,"height":38},{"text":"대양에","x":985,"y":265,"width":98,"height":38},{"text":"걸쳐","x":1104,"y":263,"width":61,"height":39},{"text":"서비스히는","x":1186,"y":262,"width":170,"height":40},{"text":"것도","x":1374,"y":262,"width":65,"height":37},{"text":"있고,","x":1458,"y":261,"width":75,"height":39},{"text":"매우","x":1552,"y":263,"width":70,"height":39},{"text":"지리적으로","x":1641,"y":264,"width":168,"height":39},{"text":"좁은","x":1823,"y":271,"width":62,"height":42}]},{"text":"지역만을 대상으로 히는것도 있다. 하위 계층 ISP들은 상위 계층 ISP들과 연결하고 상","words":[{"text":"지역만을","x":577,"y":328,"width":133,"height":38},{"text":"대상으로","x":724,"y":327,"width":133,"height":38},{"text":"히는것도","x":870,"y":325,"width":134,"height":38},{"text":"있다.","x":1019,"y":324,"width":72,"height":39},{"text":"하위","x":1107,"y":323,"width":65,"height":39},{"text":"계층","x":1190,"y":324,"width":65,"height":38},{"text":"ISP들은","x":1268,"y":323,"width":124,"height":37},{"text":"상위","x":1406,"y":321,"width":65,"height":39},{"text":"계층","x":1489,"y":322,"width":68,"height":39},{"text":"ISP들과","x":1571,"y":325,"width":129,"height":38},{"text":"연결하고","x":1715,"y":325,"width":128,"height":37},{"text":"상","x":1855,"y":335,"width":29,"height":37}]},{"text":"위 계층 ISP들은 서로 연결한다. 사용자와 콘텐츠 제공지들은 하위 계층 ISP들의 고객","words":[{"text":"위","x":576,"y":389,"width":29,"height":38},{"text":"계층","x":622,"y":389,"width":66,"height":38},{"text":"ISP들은","x":700,"y":387,"width":124,"height":38},{"text":"서로","x":837,"y":386,"width":66,"height":38},{"text":"연결한다.","x":917,"y":384,"width":140,"height":39},{"text":"사용자와","x":1073,"y":384,"width":137,"height":39},{"text":"콘텐츠","x":1221,"y":384,"width":102,"height":38},{"text":"제공지들은","x":1338,"y":382,"width":171,"height":40},{"text":"하위","x":1523,"y":383,"width":66,"height":40},{"text":"계층","x":1607,"y":385,"width":69,"height":38},{"text":"ISP들의","x":1689,"y":385,"width":120,"height":38},{"text":"고객","x":1824,"y":392,"width":57,"height":41}]},{"text":"이고 하위 계층 ISP들은 상위 계층 ISP들의 고객이다. 최근에, 주요 콘텐츠 제공자들","words":[{"text":"이고","x":575,"y":449,"width":66,"height":38},{"text":"하위","x":656,"y":448,"width":64,"height":39},{"text":"계층","x":740,"y":448,"width":65,"height":37},{"text":"ISP들은","x":820,"y":446,"width":123,"height":37},{"text":"상위","x":957,"y":445,"width":65,"height":39},{"text":"계층","x":1042,"y":445,"width":65,"height":38},{"text":"ISP들의","x":1121,"y":445,"width":122,"height":38},{"text":"고객이다.","x":1261,"y":443,"width":144,"height":40},{"text":"최근에,","x":1424,"y":442,"width":112,"height":40},{"text":"주요","x":1553,"y":447,"width":70,"height":36},{"text":"콘텐츠","x":1639,"y":446,"width":104,"height":37},{"text":"제공자들","x":1759,"y":445,"width":124,"height":48}]},{"text":"도 자신의 네트워크를 구축하였고 기능한 곳에서 하위 계층 죠P들과 직접 연결한다.","words":[{"text":"도","x":572,"y":514,"width":34,"height":28},{"text":"자신의","x":618,"y":509,"width":98,"height":39},{"text":"네트워크를","x":733,"y":507,"width":167,"height":39},{"text":"구축하였고","x":912,"y":505,"width":169,"height":39},{"text":"기능한","x":1095,"y":504,"width":102,"height":39},{"text":"곳에서","x":1208,"y":505,"width":98,"height":39},{"text":"하위","x":1324,"y":504,"width":64,"height":39},{"text":"계층","x":1405,"y":504,"width":68,"height":38},{"text":"죠P들과","x":1485,"y":507,"width":130,"heig