":"데이터의","x":1755,"y":1061,"width":125,"height":41}]},{"text":"양)을 제한하여 종단 시스템 간에 지연을 아기하며 실제로 패킷을 잃어버리기도 한다.","words":[{"text":"양)을","x":561,"y":1121,"width":81,"height":38},{"text":"제한하여","x":656,"y":1119,"width":132,"height":39},{"text":"종단","x":804,"y":1118,"width":70,"height":39},{"text":"시스템","x":888,"y":1118,"width":99,"height":38},{"text":"간에","x":1004,"y":1119,"width":65,"height":38},{"text":"지연을","x":1086,"y":1119,"width":102,"height":38},{"text":"아기하며","x":1202,"y":1120,"width":133,"height":38},{"text":"실제로","x":1354,"y":1120,"width":102,"height":37},{"text":"패킷을","x":1472,"y":1120,"width":104,"height":39},{"text":"잃어버리기도","x":1593,"y":1121,"width":206,"height":39},{"text":"한다.","x":1813,"y":1121,"width":69,"height":39}]},{"text":"한편 0 구, 현실의 물리 법칙이 처리율의 제한뿐만 아니라 지연과 손실을 야기하는 것","words":[{"text":"한편","x":559,"y":1181,"width":66,"height":37},{"text":"0","x":635,"y":1184,"width":19,"height":19},{"text":"구,","x":666,"y":1185,"width":37,"height":34},{"text":"현실의","x":721,"y":1180,"width":98,"height":37},{"text":"물리","x":837,"y":1179,"width":64,"height":38},{"text":"법칙이","x":922,"y":1179,"width":97,"height":39},{"text":"처리율의","x":1040,"y":1180,"width":132,"height":39},{"text":"제한뿐만","x":1191,"y":1181,"width":137,"height":38},{"text":"아니라","x":1344,"y":1181,"width":103,"height":38},{"text":"지연과","x":1463,"y":1182,"width":105,"height":39},{"text":"손실을","x":1582,"y":1182,"width":106,"height":38},{"text":"야기하는","x":1704,"y":1182,"width":135,"height":37},{"text":"것","x":1854,"y":1185,"width":27,"height":38}]},{"text":"은 불행한 일이다. 반면 컴퓨터 네트워크가 이러한 문제를 갖고 있기 때문에 이러한 문","words":[{"text":"은","x":557,"y":1243,"width":35,"height":36},{"text":"불행한","x":603,"y":1242,"width":105,"height":38},{"text":"일이다.","x":722,"y":1240,"width":106,"height":38},{"text":"반면","x":843,"y":1240,"width":67,"height":37},{"text":"컴퓨터","x":927,"y":1241,"width":96,"height":38},{"text":"네트워크가","x":1041,"y":1241,"width":172,"height":39},{"text":"이러한","x":1226,"y":1242,"width":103,"height":38},{"text